  "referenceNumber": "RUS0788",
  "remarks": "\nNina Viktorovna DOROKHOVA (hereafter DOROKHOVA) is a Director of InfoRos, an organisation affiliated with the Government of Russia which spreads disinformation. In her role as Director of InfoRos DOROKHOVA has provided support for and promoted actions and policies which destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
